Run one request file or every request file in a directory.

[93mFLAGS[0m
  -env, --environment string
    	Environment file to use (default "global")
  -o, --out string
    	Write responses to this path
  -timeout int
    	Seconds before a request is cancelled (default "60")

[93mARGUMENTS[0m
  <path>    - File or directory (required)

[93mEXAMPLES[0m
  $ hulak run api/users.hk.yaml
    Run one file

[93mLEARN MORE[0m
  Use `hulak <command> --help` for more information about a command.
